            </stacked_container>
            <pad_icon x="759" y="1331" width="26" height="22" color="#008F44" label_side="bottom" label="Table 2" type="table" icon_of="27" />
            <button x="303" y="959" width="65" height="34" uid="28" appearance="opaque" background="#7F00FF" color="white" style="rounded" label="Run" font-family="Arial" font-size="12" text-align="center">
                <menu_action>run</menu_action>
            </button>
            <button x="274" y="1199" width="129" height="34" uid="29" appearance="opaque" background="#0CA0FF" color="white" style="rounded" label="What can I do with this?" font-family="Arial" font-size="12" text-align="center">
                <popup x="-152" y="211" width="544" height="254" background="yellow" color="black">
                    <text_box font-family="Arial" font-size="16">This is a version of the model underlying the Lesson 2 Simulation. Remember, this model is built so that you can NOT start spending UNTIL you have reached (or exceeded) your Personal Savings Goal.&#x0D;&#x0D;When you click and open any building block, you will find an explanation for how it works. &#x0D;&#x0D;You will notice there is an extra stock here called REACH GOAL. Why do you think we put that in? And why have we added two stocks of TOTAL DEPOSITS and TOTAL SPENT $$? Click on any of the STOCKS to learn more.&#x0D;&#x0D;Explore how you can make changes (e.g., change numbers; rename or add new building blocks to make this &quot;your&quot; model). Play with it and have fun!!&#x0D;</text_box>
                </popup>
            </button>
            <text_box x="3" y="1140" uid="30" color="red" font-family="Comic Sans MS" font-size="32" font-weight="bold" text-align="center" padding="5" width="746" height="56"> Model Used in Lesson 2</text_box>
            <button x="477" y="1098" width="146" height="31" uid="31" appearance="opaque" background="red" color="white" style="square" label="Explore Model Used in Lesson 2" font-family="Arial" font-size="12" text-align="center">
                <link target="model" x="0" y="1144" />
            </button>
            <text_box x="5" y="1" uid="32" color="red" font-family="Comic Sans MS" font-size="31" font-weight="bold" text-align="center" padding="5" width="780" height="56">Can I Reach a Personal Saving &amp; Spending GOAL? </text_box>
            <button x="274" y="53" width="183" height="30" uid="33" appearance="opaque" background="#0CA0FF" color="white" style="rounded" label="Intro: Build Your Own Model!" font-family="Arial" font-size="12" text-align="center">
                <popup x="-184" y="40" width="617" height="346" background="yellow" color="black">
                    <text_box font-family="Arial" font-size="16">If you haven&apos;t modeled before, watch our Build Your Own Personal Finance Model video to help you get started with using STELLA modeling software, available at http://clexchange.org/curriculum/dollarsandsense.asp. &#x0D;&#x0D;Pick from 3 options:&#x0D;&#x0D;(1) Use this blank STELLA page to build your own model from scratch. Everything you need is here (icons/buttons for building blocks, tables and graphs, text; Word menus to run and print...); OR&#x0D;&#x0D;(2) Click on the &quot;Explore Simple Stock and Flow Model&quot; button to see the the &quot;basic&quot; pre-built stock and flow model (Go ahead and make changes -- insert new numbers, change names, add building blocks!); OR&#x0D;&#x0D;(3) Click on the &quot;Explore Model Used in Lesson 2 &quot; to explore the actual model used in Lesson 2 (it&apos;s a bit more complicated, but everything in it is explained). &#x0D;&#x0D;Start wherever you want! Play with it and have fun!!&#x0D;</text_box>
                </popup>
            </button>
            <button x="481" y="530" width="146" height="31" uid="34" appearance="opaque" background="red" color="white" style="square" label="Explore Model Used in Lesson 2" font-family="Arial" font-size="12" text-align="center">
                <link target="model" x="0" y="1144" />
            </button>
            <button x="319" y="530" width="146" height="31" uid="35" appearance="opaque" background="red" color="white" style="square" label="Explore Simple Stock and Flow Model" font-family="Arial" font-size="12" text-align="center">
                <link target="model" x="0" y="572" />
            </button>
            <button x="158" y="530" width="147" height="32" uid="36" appearance="opaque" background="#E0E0E0" color="white" style="square" label="Build Your Own Model " font-family="Arial" font-size="12" text-align="center">
                <link target="model" x="0" y="0" />
            </button>
